{"assets":["/statement-assets/f4454f1c09088612cf25c089930eac09b806174fd562841918eb1a7ece3e08ba.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1517","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"G. Starry Night Camping"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"At the foot of Liyushan Mountain, $$$n$$$ tents will be carefully arranged to provide accommodation for those who are willing to experience the joy of approaching nature, the tranquility of the night, and the bright starry sky."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The $$$i$$$-th tent is located at the point of $$$(x_i, y_i)$$$ and has a weight of $$$w_i$$$. A tent is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"important"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if and only if both $$$x_i$$$ and $$$y_i$$$ are even. You need to remove some tents such that for each remaining important tent $$$(x, y)$$$, there do not exist $$$3$$$ other tents $$$(x'_1, y'_1)$$$, $$$(x'_2, y'_2)$$$ and $$$(x'_3, y'_3)$$$ such that both conditions are true: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$|x'_j-x|, |y'_j - y|\\leq 1$$$ for all $$$j \\in \\{1, 2, 3\\}$$$, and "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" these four tents form a parallelogram (or a rectangle) and one of its sides is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"parallel to the $$$x$$$-axis"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Please maximize the sum of the weights of the tents that are "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"not"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" removed. Print the maximum value."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1\\leq n\\leq 1\\,000$$$), representing the number of tents."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each of the next $$$n$$$ lines contains three integers $$$x_i$$$, $$$y_i$$$ and $$$w_i$$$ ($$$-10^9\\leq x_i,y_i \\leq 10^9$$$, $$$1\\leq w_i\\leq 10^9$$$), representing the coordinate of the $$$i$$$-th tent and its weight. No two tents are located at the same point."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A single integer — the maximum sum of the weights of the remaining tents."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n0 0 4\n0 1 5\n1 0 3\n1 1 1\n-1 1 2\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n12\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n32\n2 2 1\n2 3 1\n3 2 1\n3 3 1\n2 6 1\n2 5 1\n3 6 1\n3 5 1\n2 8 1\n2 9 1\n1 8 1\n1 9 1\n2 12 1\n2 11 1\n1 12 1\n1 11 1\n6 2 1\n7 2 1\n6 3 1\n5 3 1\n6 6 1\n7 6 1\n5 5 1\n6 5 1\n6 8 1\n5 8 1\n6 9 1\n7 9 1\n6 12 1\n5 12 1\n6 11 1\n7 11 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n24\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here is an illustration of the second example. Black triangles indicate the important tents. This example also indicates all $$$8$$$ forbidden patterns."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/f4454f1c09088612cf25c089930eac09b806174fd562841918eb1a7ece3e08ba.png"},"kind":"image"}],"kind":"container"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"G","problemCode":"1517G","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1517/problem/G"}